1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,320
Welcome to Dan's Lab.

2
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:04,820
I'm Dan, and this is where we explore artificial

3
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:08,540
intelligence, test new tools, and turn ideas into

4
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:09,320
things that work.

5
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,600
Here's how I use Stream Studio.

6
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:13,600
I start with a script.

7
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:15,600
When a line mentions a product QR code,

8
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:17,600
the agent can choose a website card,

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,600
capture the real page,

10
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:21,480
and focus the camera on the code.

11
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:24,480
Under the hood, the editor is built with React.

12
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:27,480
A Python API saves the scene plan.

13
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:30,480
A worker uses FFmpeg to put the layers together

14
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:33,480
so I can open a preview and see exactly what changed.

15
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:36,880
For DansLab, the advantage is in the second edit.

16
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:39,280
Watch the same card move left.

17
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:44,080
The reveal comes later, but the website capture and my voice stay the same.

18
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:48,440
Another team can pick up that scene and keep working from the same materials.
